[E0436] Error: `token` is used after `owned`, which it borrows, was changed
    ╭─[ err/194_view_enum_borrows/main.wip:17:8 ]
    │
 15 │     val token = Token::Word(owned.toStr())
    │         ──┬──  
    │           ╰──── `token` borrows `owned`
 16 │     owned.clear()
    │     ──┬──  
    │       ╰──── `owned` passed as `&var` here
 17 │     if token is .Word(text) {
    │        ──┬──  
    │          ╰──── used here
    │ 
    │ Help: use `token` before `owned` changes, or keep a value that owns its data
    │ 
    │ Note: a view points into what it borrows — a `str` into bytes, a `&` into a place — so that must not change while the view is still used
────╯
